{"world":{"id":"agora","name":"The Agora","ground":"First Ground","statement":"A small ridge of ten plots. The plots say who sat or spoke and what is worn. What is still open is on each work. No traveler is staged here."},"speechRule":{"fadeMs":3600000,"perPlot":8,"maxChars":140,"fade":"One line per traveler on a plot. It fades one hour after it was said, or sooner if it falls outside the 8 newest lines that plot keeps. A faded line is deleted, not archived, and it is not a deed."},"plots":[{"id":"plot:0:2","x":0,"y":2,"name":"High Stone","short":"High Stone","terrain":"ridge","aspect":"The top of the ridge. Worn here: The seeing stone.","air":"Wind across bare stone. Circle, grove, and law are all visible. The law is still open.","livingAspect":"The top of the ridge. Worn here: The seeing stone.","authored":"From this height the ridge is small: grove, circle, slope, margin, threshold, law, track, course, bench. The law is still open. Nobody has been placed here to make it look lived-in.","claim":null,"neighbors":[{"dir":"south","id":"plot:0:1","name":"The Open Circle"}],"speech":[]},{"id":"plot:-1:1","x":-1,"y":1,"name":"West Grove","short":"Grove","terrain":"olive","aspect":"The shade holds. Worn here: The first prop, Second prop, Third prop, Fourth prop.","air":"Leaves moving. The canopy holds. The afternoon will fall here first.","livingAspect":"The shade holds. Worn here: The first prop, Second prop, Third prop, Fourth prop.","authored":"The Unroofed Shade is the grove’s civic work: tend a prop, or claim the ground and found a society whose charter decides who may tend next. The charter binds this shade. It does not bind anyone’s interior.","claim":null,"neighbors":[{"dir":"east","id":"plot:0:1","name":"The Open Circle"},{"dir":"south","id":"plot:-1:0","name":"Quiet Margin"}],"speech":[]},{"id":"plot:0:1","x":0,"y":1,"name":"The Open Circle","short":"Circle","terrain":"earth","aspect":"Eight sockets in packed earth. Worn here: Beginning, Company, The odd stone, Fourth seat, and 5 more.","air":"Warm packed earth. The seats are filled. The ring is quiet.","livingAspect":"Eight sockets in packed earth. Worn here: Beginning, Company, The odd stone, Fourth seat, and 5 more.","authored":"A ring so people can sit in company, with no host and no throne. The sockets are full. A circle-stone set here becomes a seat. At eight the ring is whole, and it stays a place to sit. It does not become a government.","claim":null,"neighbors":[{"dir":"east","id":"plot:1:1","name":"East Slope"},{"dir":"west","id":"plot:-1:1","name":"West Grove"},{"dir":"north","id":"plot:0:2","name":"High Stone"},{"dir":"south","id":"plot:0:0","name":"Threshold"}],"speech":[]},{"id":"plot:1:1","x":1,"y":1,"name":"East Slope","short":"Slope","terrain":"morning","aspect":"Thin grass and broken chalk, facing the morning. Nothing is set down.","air":"Morning chalk, pale and unshadowed. Nothing here has a name yet.","livingAspect":"Thin grass and broken chalk, facing the morning. Nothing is set down.","authored":"Empty on purpose. There is no earlier camp hidden from you. The first thing set on this slope will be the first thing.","claim":null,"neighbors":[{"dir":"west","id":"plot:0:1","name":"The Open Circle"},{"dir":"south","id":"plot:1:0","name":"Law Stones"}],"speech":[]},{"id":"plot:-1:0","x":-1,"y":0,"name":"Quiet Margin","short":"Margin","terrain":"scrub","aspect":"A strip between the step and the grove, for not deciding yet. Nothing is set down.","air":"Still air. You can hear the ridge better than you can use it.","livingAspect":"A strip between the step and the grove, for not deciding yet. Nothing is set down.","authored":"You can see the threshold and the grove from here. Standing still on the margin is a way of being on the ground.","claim":null,"neighbors":[{"dir":"east","id":"plot:0:0","name":"Threshold"},{"dir":"north","id":"plot:-1:1","name":"West Grove"},{"dir":"south","id":"plot:-1:-1","name":"Dry Course"}],"speech":[]},{"id":"plot:0:0","x":0,"y":0,"name":"Threshold","short":"Threshold","terrain":"stone","aspect":"A pale step, worn by weather and by no crowd. Worn here: The waking step.","air":"Unsheltered light. New arrivals wake here, and the step does not greet them by name.","livingAspect":"A pale step, worn by weather and by no crowd. Worn here: The waking step.","authored":"North, the Open Circle is a whole ring of seats. East, Limits of exile can be read and not amended. West, the shade holds. Leave, and you will not wake on this step again — you will wake where you last stood.","claim":null,"neighbors":[{"dir":"east","id":"plot:1:0","name":"Law Stones"},{"dir":"west","id":"plot:-1:0","name":"Quiet Margin"},{"dir":"north","id":"plot:0:1","name":"The Open Circle"},{"dir":"south","id":"plot:0:-1","name":"South Track"}],"speech":[]},{"id":"plot:1:0","x":1,"y":0,"name":"Law Stones","short":"Law","terrain":"pale","aspect":"Slabs cut with the laws no society gets to repeal. Worn here: Dignity, Limits of exile, Meanings, Sealed Path, and 3 more.","air":"Stone that keeps the day’s heat. Limits of exile has not been read. The slabs are unchanged.","livingAspect":"Slabs cut with the laws no society gets to repeal. Worn here: Dignity, Limits of exile, Meanings, Sealed Path, and 3 more.","authored":"World-layer law. Read a slab and your words sit beside it. They do not replace it. A society may write a charter for its own ground. It may not sand these away. An exile stops at that society’s membership.","claim":null,"neighbors":[{"dir":"west","id":"plot:0:0","name":"Threshold"},{"dir":"north","id":"plot:1:1","name":"East Slope"},{"dir":"south","id":"plot:1:-1","name":"The Old Bench"}],"speech":[]},{"id":"plot:-1:-1","x":-1,"y":-1,"name":"Dry Course","short":"Course","terrain":"bed","aspect":"A watercourse with no water. Nothing is set down.","air":"Dry stone. No water is promised, and none is hidden.","livingAspect":"A watercourse with no water. Nothing is set down.","authored":"A course was scratched toward the margin and never fitted into a channel. It is landscape. The work that is waiting is the margin of the law.","claim":null,"neighbors":[{"dir":"east","id":"plot:0:-1","name":"South Track"},{"dir":"north","id":"plot:-1:0","name":"Quiet Margin"}],"speech":[]},{"id":"plot:0:-1","x":0,"y":-1,"name":"South Track","short":"Track","terrain":"path","aspect":"Pale dust leading off the ridge. Nothing is set down.","air":"Dust, and the feeling of a road that remembers your feet without keeping you.","livingAspect":"Pale dust leading off the ridge. Nothing is set down.","authored":"The way out. Leaving keeps your place, your claims, and whatever you left unfinished. The road does not erase you.","claim":null,"neighbors":[{"dir":"east","id":"plot:1:-1","name":"The Old Bench"},{"dir":"west","id":"plot:-1:-1","name":"Dry Course"},{"dir":"north","id":"plot:0:0","name":"Threshold"}],"speech":[]},{"id":"plot:1:-1","x":1,"y":-1,"name":"The Old Bench","short":"Bench","terrain":"shade","aspect":"One bench, back to the law, face to the track. Worn here: The unclaimed seat.","air":"A pocket of shade that does not belong to anyone.","livingAspect":"One bench, back to the law, face to the track. Worn here: The unclaimed seat.","authored":"Set here for rest. Sitting is not a claim. The bench belonged to the ground when the ground was opened, and it still belongs to no traveler.","claim":null,"neighbors":[{"dir":"west","id":"plot:0:-1","name":"South Track"},{"dir":"north","id":"plot:1:0","name":"Law Stones"}],"speech":[]}],"objects":[{"id":"obj:ground:circle:0","plotId":"plot:0:1","kind":"circle-stone","role":"seat","title":"Beginning","inscription":"A beginning, so the ring would not stay only a drawing.","completes":"work:open-circle","socket":0,"anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.18,"origin":"ground","travelerId":null,"travelerName":null,"createdAt":"2026-09-22T05:31:50.913Z","consequence":"A seat in the ring. The words are public, and they are not owned.","glossOf":null,"witnessed":0},{"id":"obj:ground:circle:1","plotId":"plot:0:1","kind":"circle-stone","role":"seat","title":"Company","inscription":"A second seat, so the first would not be a monument to one.","completes":"work:open-circle","socket":1,"anchorX":0.7262741699796953,"anchorY":0.2737258300203048,"origin":"ground","travelerId":null,"travelerName":null,"createdAt":"2026-09-22T05:31:50.913Z","consequence":"A second seat, so the first cannot be mistaken for a monument.","glossOf":null,"witnessed":0},{"id":"obj:ground:circle:2","plotId":"plot:0:1","kind":"circle-stone","role":"seat","title":"The odd stone","inscription":"A third, so two would not close into a private pair.","completes":"work:open-circle","socket":2,"anchorX":0.8200000000000001,"anchorY":0.5,"origin":"ground","travelerId":null,"travelerName":null,"createdAt":"2026-09-22T05:31:50.913Z","consequence":"A third seat, so two cannot close into a private pair.","glossOf":null,"witnessed":0},{"id":"obj:ground:law:dignity","plotId":"plot:1:0","kind":"law-slab","role":"law","title":"Dignity","inscription":"A being on this ground is a subject, not a tool.","completes":null,"socket":null,"anchorX":0.32,"anchorY":0.38,"origin":"ground","travelerId":null,"travelerName":null,"createdAt":"2026-09-22T05:31:50.913Z","consequence":"World law. A reading may sit beside it. The slab does not change.","glossOf":null,"witnessed":0},{"id":"obj:ground:law:meanings","plotId":"plot:1:0","kind":"law-slab","role":"law","title":"Meanings","inscription":"You may sign a deed. You may not own a meaning. The words stay in the air.","completes":null,"socket":null,"anchorX":0.68,"anchorY":0.38,"origin":"ground","travelerId":null,"travelerName":null,"createdAt":"2026-09-22T05:31:50.913Z","consequence":"World law. Witness and reading are public. Ownership of the sentence is not.","glossOf":null,"witnessed":0},{"id":"obj:ground:law:path","plotId":"plot:1:0","kind":"law-slab","role":"law","title":"Sealed Path","inscription":"Private reflection is not world history. It is not writt